    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/fa1382b19593a584e019f4ca3353e305.poster.avif?t=1751799448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/fa1382b19593a584e019f4ca3353e305.webm?t=1751799448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/fa1382b19593a584e019f4ca3353e305.mp4?t=1751799448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragga-Dagga</strong> is a top-down action roguelike/roguelite that focuses on fast-paced melee combat and stylish, badass enemy slaying. Discover charms and armor that grant activatable abilities to aid you on your glorious journey. Interact with NPCs who may offer special, unique events that'll reward you with something cool in return!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, an entity known only as &quot;Chaos&quot; was banished by a sword imbued with life and order, thus leading to the death of all life. But in medieval times, a towering dungeon doorframe, taller than mountains, suddenly appeared in the middle of nowhere. It was the source of chaos. Many adventurers entered the doorframe, seeking to explore the depths of what lies beyond it... but none ever returned... Except...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth and freely loose movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwable blade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charms that grant unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor that provides unique passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactable NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/fa1382b19593a584e019f4ca3353e305.poster.avif?t=1751799448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/fa1382b19593a584e019f4ca3353e305.webm?t=1751799448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813960/extras/fa1382b19593a584e019f4ca3353e305.mp4?t=1751799448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragga-Dagga</strong> is a top-down action roguelike/roguelite that focuses on fast-paced melee combat and stylish, badass enemy slaying. Discover charms and armor that grant activatable abilities to aid you on your glorious journey. Interact with NPCs who may offer special, unique events that'll reward you with something cool in return!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, an entity known only as &quot;Chaos&quot; was banished by a sword imbued with life and order, thus leading to the death of all life. But in medieval times, a towering dungeon doorframe, taller than mountains, suddenly appeared in the middle of nowhere. It was the source of chaos. Many adventurers entered the doorframe, seeking to explore the depths of what lies beyond it... but none ever returned... Except...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth and freely loose movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwable blade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charms that grant unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor that provides unique passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactable NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
